{"about_the_game":"In the fictional world, populated by antropomorphic beasts, there is cruel TV-show. The participants of the show are sent to the dangerous island to compete, survive and win the big money prize.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game genres</h2>&quot;Jaws &amp; Claws&quot; is a mix of such genres like 2D-platformer, fighter, beat'em up, party game. Gameplay is full of fights, gunfire, movement and rivalry.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>Characteristic features of fighting games: framedata, vif and blocking, spacing, strike links, combos, combo breakers, etc.<br>There are many different heroes with unique designs and characters, and the experience of playing for each hero is based on its built-in unique mechanics.<br>The Island mode is a classic example of an arcade platformer - many levels with obstacles, traps, the need to solve simple tasks and look for a way out.<br>Playing together in one or in different teams with other players, both in combat modes and in sports (football, basketball).<br>The game is played at a convenient pace, choosing different modes. From fast PVP matches to long PVE missions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/e4087674433da4286ea23b9ff91b48d4.avif?t=1770544089\" width=500 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2>   - Island (story mode 14+ regions, 80+ stages)<br>   - Fast match (up to 8 players/AI, Free for All, lots of stages)<br>   - Team Brawl (2-4 teams of players/AIs, lots of stages)<br>   - Rabbidball (sports mode, football/basketball analogue, 2 teams, lots of stages with various rules) <br>   - Survival (1 or 2 players must survive agints waves of enemies)<br>   - Boss Raid (small team engages the mighty bosses)<br>   - Head to Head (classic fighter mode, player vs player, or player vs AI)<br>   - Practice (mode to practice moves and combos)<br>   - Tutorial (game basics is shown here)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/79bf9c02412f4a25d49b68b3e6bfaa9d.poster.avif?t=1770544089\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/79bf9c02412f4a25d49b68b3e6bfaa9d.webm?t=1770544089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/79bf9c02412f4a25d49b68b3e6bfaa9d.mp4?t=1770544089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2>Cooperative play in any mode, 2 to 8 players.<br>The ability to use a series of punches against your opponents using various interesting combinations.<br>Original Hard'n'Heavy soundtrack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/fa11c7f2943fe8081b682294738f8d5c.poster.avif?t=1770544089\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/fa11c7f2943fe8081b682294738f8d5c.webm?t=1770544089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/fa11c7f2943fe8081b682294738f8d5c.mp4?t=1770544089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable characters</h2>Crocco, Buzz, Kong Jr., Iggy, Rhino, Frosty, King, Mini, Jabber, Lupin, Catsu-Hero, Bosch, Tenrek, Sever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/0d8bfc83eb427d0b66bf6d35757721f0.poster.avif?t=1770544089\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706740/extras/0d8bfc83eb427d0b66bf6d35757721f0.